sewing needle tool tailoring~
A long steel needle with a wide eye, threaded with a length of waxed cord
that will pull through leather as readily as cloth.

Wear it to hold it in your sewing needle tool slot. Tailoring projects
need it there, and CRAFT TOOLS lists it once it is worn.
